@RAG.service_HostAddress = http://localhost:5110

### Ingest a document (requires Authorization: Bearer <token>)
POST {{RAG.service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rag/ingest
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "documentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "filePath": "C:/path/to/file.pdf"
}

###

### Query the RAG index
POST {{RAG.service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rag/query
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "query": "example question",
  "topK": 5
}

###
